\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {IV}{\ignorespaces Fault containment preserves legality, while cold recovery misses the original service deadlines. Six short conditions use one fixed clip and two fresh trials per policy. Each cell lists Conservative above Full-call; ranges are observed minima/maxima. Illegal; done gives illegal installations and completed/2 trials. Reject/mutation counts local rejections and selected changes. New result is fault-to-actual-certified consumption of a new fact whose call completes after the fault, excluding old-fact replay and replacement readiness. D2/C8 counts joint whole-run passes; EOS counts D2 misses. Both-board energy runs through physical drain.}}{10}{table.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:native_reliability}{{IV}{10}{Fault containment preserves legality, while cold recovery misses the original service deadlines. Six short conditions use one fixed clip and two fresh trials per policy. Each cell lists Conservative above Full-call; ranges are observed minima/maxima. Illegal; done gives illegal installations and completed/2 trials. Reject/mutation counts local rejections and selected changes. New result is fault-to-actual-certified consumption of a new fact whose call completes after the fault, excluding old-fact replay and replacement readiness. D2/C8 counts joint whole-run passes; EOS counts D2 misses. Both-board energy runs through physical drain}{table.4}{}}
